  "summary": "Contact: linkedin@npdev.me\n\nI’m Nisarga, an engineer driven by building systems that solve meaningful problems for users. Over the course of my career at Roblox, Lyft, and my own startup Apeiro, I’ve developed expertise in full-stack engineering, distributed systems, system design, and architecture.\n\nToday, I lead engineering efforts focused on user-facing authentication and authorization experiences while leveraging applied AI tooling to accelerate software development, improve engineering productivity, and help teams ship secure, high-impact features faster.\n\nThroughout my career, I’ve enjoyed working across a wide range of domains, from crafting delightful user experiences and building 0-to-1 systems to detect malicious actors, to deploying IoT sensor networks that detect water leakages in warehouses. I enjoy turning complex technical challenges into reliable, scalable, and elegant solutions.\n\nI’m always excited to connect with engineers, product builders, and innovators. Feel free to reach out if you’d like to collaborate, exchange ideas, or chat about distributed systems, applied AI, engineering leadership, and building products at scale.",
