    "description": "Identity & Integrity\n\n- Delivered impact through developing features in large scale Go and Python identity and integrity microservices powering Lyft’s millions of users.\n- Aided in developing a powerful identity graph solution to help uncover bad actors.\n- Executed a significant company wide migration of internal customer support search from MongoDB prefix search to Elasticsearch.\n- Aided in the execution of the migration of core identity service databases from MongoDB to DynamoDB within the company deadline.  \n- Implemented best practices of device bound security and emulator detection through Apple Device Attestation.\n- Developed frontend functionality powering GDPR compliance and enabling users to have transparency into their data.\n- Developed user facing push prompts to verify identity via the “Is that you?” signup feature.\n- Developed the backend API powering user profile stats.\n",
